SUMMARY:The Rock And Roll Playhouse Presents: Uncle Jeb's Farm
LOCATION:Brooklyn Bowl\, Williamsburg
DESCRIPTION:Uncle Jeb's Farm is an original children's musical (rock opera)
 
\, that follows the life of Tica\, a ladybug with only one day to live. Tic
 
a's adventures take her to the magical world of Uncle Jeb's Farm\, where sh
 
e encounters a series of other animals\, that further her journey in life. 
 
The show features original music and writing that is appropriate for childr
 
en from three to ten years old. The play deals with themes of mortality\, f
 
riendship and environmental awareness that both children and parents can en
 
joy together. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/the-rock-and-rol
 
l-playhouse-presents-brooklyn-new-york-10-10-2026/event/00006505E49BC33B
